<header class="page-heading"><p class="eyebrow">Questions → experiments → things that work</p><h1>Work, in a few forms.</h1><p>Research, useful little tools, and ideas built with a team. A selected collection, with room for whatever comes next.</p></header>
<div class="work-toolbar" aria-label="Find work"><div class="filters" role="group" aria-label="Filter work"><button class="filter active" data-filter="All" aria-pressed="true">All work</button>{% assign categories = site.data.work | map: 'type' | uniq %}{% for category in categories %}<button class="filter" data-filter="{{ category | escape }}" aria-pressed="false">{{ category | escape }}{% unless category == 'Research' %}s{% endunless %}</button>{% endfor %}</div><label class="search-label"><span class="sr-only">Search work</span><svg width="18" height="18" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.6" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="10" cy="10" r="6"/><path d="m15 15 6 6"/></svg><input type="search" id="work-search" placeholder="Find something…"></label></div>
<p id="work-count" class="sr-only" role="status" aria-live="polite"></p><div class="work-grid">{% for item in site.data.work %}<article class="card work-card" id="{{ item.id | escape }}" data-category="{{ item.type | escape }}" data-search="{{ item.title | escape }} {{ item.summary | escape }} {{ item.tags | join: ' ' | escape }}"><div class="work-card-content"><div class="item-meta"><span>{{ item.type | escape }}</span><span>{{ item.year | escape }}</span></div><h2>{{ item.title | escape }}</h2><p>{{ item.summary | escape }}</p><div class="tags">{% for tag in item.tags %}<span>{{ tag | escape }}</span>{% endfor %}</div><details><summary>About this work <span aria-hidden="true">+</span></summary><p>{{ item.description | escape }}</p></details>{% if item.url != '' %}<a class="text-link" href="{{ item.url | escape }}" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer">{{ item.linkLabel | escape }} <span aria-hidden="true">↗</span></a>{% endif %}</div></article>{% endfor %}</div><div class="empty-results card" hidden><h2>No matches this time.</h2><p>Try another search or show all work.</p><button class="button" id="clear-filters">Clear filters <span>↗</span></button></div>
